{"id":"fv26rbxe6a9zyjjleiz3hqtll","title":"云覆盖变化对气候影响的模拟研究揭示关键偏差","originalTitle":"Why similar changes in cloud cover can have different climate effects","summary":"美国怀俄明大学研究人员使用250种气候模型配置，发现云覆盖变化的气候效应取决于云的反射性，模型在模拟风如何影响跨温差海洋区域的云时存在持续偏差。研究指出，改进云模拟需更准确地代表基本过程，以提高气候预测的可靠性。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-similar-cloud-climate-effects.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T21:10:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T21:19:32.903Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T21:19:32.903Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["研究成果"],"score":37,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"cc97a134-7dfe-46f1-abf2-2f096713d878","title":"怀俄明大学研究揭示云反射性差异导致气候效应不同步"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"cc97a134-7dfe-46f1-abf2-2f096713d878","title":"怀俄明大学研究揭示云反射性差异导致气候效应不同步"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fYc2Bz8GLqvs","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}